    "In Founderizer already" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ya está en Founderizer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Tailscale: Credential → OAuth, All to Write, Generate. The secret shows once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En Tailscale: Credential → OAuth, All a Write, Generate. El secreto se muestra una sola vez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In [1Password](https://support.1password.com/export/), choose File › Export, then your account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En [1Password](https://support.1password.com/export/), elige Archivo › Exportar y luego tu cuenta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In [Bitwarden](https://bitwarden.com/help/export-your-data/), open Tools › Export. For Secrets Manager: Settings › Export data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En [Bitwarden](https://bitwarden.com/help/export-your-data/), abre Herramientas › Exportar. Para Secrets Manager: Configuración › Exportar datos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a message, %@ and its transcripts would have it. Saved as a secret, it goes straight into the vault, and %@ gets only its name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En un mensaje, %@ y sus transcripciones lo tendrían. Guardado como secreto, va directo a la bóveda y %@ solo recibe su nombre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In messages" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En mensajes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In place" : {
