            "value" : "Su servicio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its service restarts, so anything %@ starts meanwhile is lost. The hub's own update waits until %@ is idle; this one cannot. Founderizer looks at the server again afterwards." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su servicio se reinicia, así que se pierde todo lo que %@ empiece mientras tanto. La actualización del propio hub espera a que %@ esté inactivo; esta no puede. Después, Founderizer vuelve a revisar el servidor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its service restarts, so the %lld tasks %@ is working on now end. The hub's own update waits until %@ is idle; this one cannot. Founderizer looks at the server again afterwards." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su servicio se reinicia, así que terminan las %lld tareas en las que %@ trabaja ahora. La actualización del propio hub espera a que %@ esté inactivo; esta no puede. Después, Founderizer vuelve a revisar el servidor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its service restarts, so “%@”, which %@ is working on now, ends. The hub's own update waits until %@ is idle; this one cannot. Founderizer looks at the server again afterwards." : {
