    },
    "The Knowledge files section of %@ has a line that is not a file. Correct it in the agent's profile first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La sección Archivos de conocimiento de %@ tiene una línea que no es un archivo. Corrígela primero en el perfil del agente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The MCP servers you connected are signed in on the old server. Until each is connected again, the agents that had those tools are told the server is not connected. The copy names the servers and their addresses." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
