    "The central vault on the hub's server holds another Mac's owner key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La bóveda central del servidor del hub tiene la clave de propietario de otro Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The central vault takes a value only with a fingerprint, and this one has none: it has fewer than 8 characters or holds white space. Nothing was sent." : {
      "localizations" : {
